  "updated_at": "2026-01-15T14:44:54.460933+00:00",
  "source": "https://www.cds.caltech.edu/~murray/amwiki/index.php/Main_Page",
  "reference": "\u00c5str\u00f6m, K.J. & Murray, R.M. (2008). Feedback Systems: An Introduction for Scientists and Engineers. Princeton UP."
}